ine, she is forced to confront traumas from the past and define a new course for her life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158650/extras/a8c54984803b42b9f71a304e3accc1b2.poster.avif?t=1767708859\" width=800 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158650/extras/a8c54984803b42b9f71a304e3accc1b2.webm?t=1767708859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158650/extras/a8c54984803b42b9f71a304e3accc1b2.mp4?t=1767708859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ITINERARY</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Get aboard a short, atmospheric story by Tiago Rech, award-winning author of <i>TELEFORUM, Dodgeball Academia, No Place for Bravery, and Galaxy of Pen &amp; Paper</i>.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>What is your destination? Find 5+ endings created by your choices.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience a unique, dark art style in 4K resolution.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interact with bizarre passengers during a surreal journey.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go to funerals, weep for the dead.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find yourself amidst your traumas... or run away forever.</li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Multi-core 1.6GHz or faster 64-bit CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX® 11 compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"]